        "id": 40567,
        "name": "dypaca",
        "username": "dypaca",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-17T00:25:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You assigned the damage correctly, but I have a suspicion that you may be doing Cryobot wrong.&nbsp; No matter how much damage he takes, he just does one damage to all non-hero targets, so you actually want to hit him with the smallest amount (over zero) that you can.</p><p>Maybe I'm wrong, if the minions had already taken damage or there was a double bonus then cryobot could certainly&nbsp;destroy them all.&nbsp; It's just when you mentioned the +1 after combat shotgun I got the impression that you might be incorrectly having cryobot dish out 5 damage to all non-hero targets.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:14:15.134Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
